WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
- We're gonna get to that,
but first Dolly Parton.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.370
So, I love her.
- Yeah.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:06.780
- And I know you do too.
- Yes!

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.480
So what is the connection
with Dolly and your son?

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.490
- Okay, so I did this,

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.290
there was like a anthology series

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.940
- Yes, I know.
- called Heartstrings.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.595
And I did one of the episodes and for

00:00:17.595 --> 00:00:20.850
like the premiere of it Dolly
flew like all the casting crew

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:24.840
out to Dollywood and, you
know, she's so generous

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:27.060
and she's so just salt
of the earth, right?

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.860
So she would go around
to every single person

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:29.700
and she would talk to them

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.380
and just really look at
them right in the eye.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.540
I took my mom and my son.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.630
She sees my son and she
kind of does a double-take

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.470
and she's like, "Oh."

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:41.047
And she kind of caresses
his cheek and she's like,

00:00:41.047 --> 00:00:42.510
"You have a face for the movies."

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:46.050
And so after that point
Wolf, my son, goes around

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:49.208
telling everybody that Dolly
Parton is his godmother.

00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:51.226
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:51.226 --> 00:00:52.059
I mean, apparently that's all it takes?

00:00:52.059 --> 00:00:54.450
- I love the connection.
- Yeah, so it's like

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:55.470
- Point A to B.
- Exactly.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.510
- She said I had a face for
the movies, she's my godmother.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.860
- Also, by the way,

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:03.046
he knows that he wants Dolly
Parton to be his godmother.

00:01:03.046 --> 00:01:04.440
- Don't we all?
- Who wouldn't?

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:05.273
- Of course!

